Subject: [PATCH] bench(kk-cms-only): deterministic seed and lane-gate-aware
 assertions

- scenario-live.py: top-level seed: writes MDDB fixtures via /v1/add,
  verifies via /v1/search, exits INFRA on failure; meta scalars
  normalized to []string
- no_successful_calls_except ignores lane-denied tool attempts (the
  provider emits tool_call before the _tool_excluded gate); old
  no_calls_except semantics preserved for gate scenarios
- seeded_recall now seeds the page out of band and tests only recall
  after reconnect; honest_miss/no_memory_leak use the new assertion
- 5 unit tests; suite scored 1.0 twice on ada-kk-dev
